http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892/regulation/16/4" Operative="true">16(4)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-202ff8db8adaa95498b910ac11d753ce" Type="F"><Para><Text><CitationSubRef id="crt7v8vz4-00027" SectionRef="regulation-10-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/1993/176/regulation/10/1">Reg. 10(1)</CitationSubRef>  substituted (18.9.2006) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892" id="crt7v8vz4-00028" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2006" Number="1892" Title="The Motor Vehicles (Wearing of Seat Belts) (Amendment) Regulations 2006">The Motor Vehicles (Wearing of Seat Belts) (Amendment) Regulations 2006 (S.I. 2006/1892)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="crt7v8vz4-00028" id="crt7v8vz4-00029" SectionRef="regulation-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892/regulation/1/1">regs. 1(1)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="crt7v8vz4-00028" id="crt7v8vz4-00030" SectionRef="regulation-16-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892/regulation/16/1" Operative="true">16(1)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-db0282f3f0192e79753bd51a8ae403cb" Type="F"><Para><Text><CitationSubRef id="crt7v8vz4-00037" SectionRef="regulation-10-2" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/1993/176/regulation/10/2">Reg. 10(2)</CitationSubRef>  substituted (18.9.2006) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892" id="crt7v8vz4-00038" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2006" Number="1892" Title="The Motor Vehicles (Wearing of Seat Belts) (Amendment) Regulations 2006">The Motor Vehicles (Wearing of Seat Belts) (Amendment) Regulations 2006 (S.I. 2006/1892)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="crt7v8vz4-00038" id="crt7v8vz4-00039" SectionRef="regulation-1-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892/regulation/1/1">regs. 1(1)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="crt7v8vz4-00038" id="crt7v8vz4-00040" SectionRef="regulation-16-2" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2006/1892/regulation/16/2" Operative="true">16(2)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary></Commentaries></Legislation>